  "introduction": [
    "Becoming one with a living mist bit by bit, the Phasescale Knight can create duplicates of themselves to aid them, either in efforts to distract enemies, take hits in their place, defend them, or cover distances quickly. Their weapons carry an ink-like misty substance that it pulls through space as it moves, forming like a billowing cloud behind them."
